# SKIMMER: four pads, TEAMS 2 VS 2 (coral pads 1 and 3, teal pads 2 and 4),
# computer NORMAL, plain table, rate 60. Play until TEAL scores at frame 282.
# Run (from boards/desktop): pocketme-sim --boot off --fps 60 --frames 430 --script skimmer.script --shot <frames> --out <folder>

# Pads 2, 3 and 4 are plugged in from the start.
0 p2 pad on
0 p3 pad on
0 p4 pad on
# --- home screen (boot off): step right 11 tiles to SKIMMER, then start it
46 press right
47 release right
48 press right
49 release right
50 press right
51 release right
52 press right
53 release right
54 press right
55 release right
56 press right
57 release right
58 press right
59 release right
60 press right
61 release right
62 press right
63 release right
64 press right
65 release right
66 press right
67 release right
68 press south   # start SKIMMER
69 release south

# Title menu: three DOWNs to TEAMS, one RIGHT to 2 VS 2, three UPs back to PLAY, then A.
80 press down
81 release down
82 press down
83 release down
84 press down
85 release down
86 press right
87 release right
88 press up
89 release up
90 press up
91 release up
92 press up
93 release up
100 press south
101 release south

